  "project_description": "A submodule of GOV Notify Integration that provides a Views query backend over the Government Notify message log. It exposes a 'GovUK Notification Message Log' base table whose rows come live from the Notify listNotifications API, with fields (id, type, timestamps, status, subject, body, created_by) and exposed filters for id, type and status, so sites can build delivery-status dashboards in Views.",
